WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.561
"This is terrible!" Sid said.

2
00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:14.005
"The tree has no apples!"

3
00:00:14.006 --> 00:00:16.081
Tor shrugged.

4
00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:23.296
"It's not a big deal.

5
00:00:23.297 --> 00:00:29.326
Let's pick berries instead."

6
00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:36.784
Sid frowned. "It is a big deal!

7
00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:41.598
I want apples for the party!"

8
00:00:41.599 --> 00:00:46.056
Tor started to gather berries.

9
00:00:46.057 --> 00:00:53.401
Sid moaned. "This stinks!"

10
00:00:53.402 --> 00:01:02.852
Tor rolled her eyes.

11
00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:06.444
"I have lots of berries, Sid."

12
00:01:06.445 --> 00:01:11.091
"Apples are better than berries!" Sid said.

13
00:01:11.092 --> 00:01:14.991
"Ugh!" Tor said.

14
00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:18.637
"Don't be so grumpy, Sid!"

15
00:01:18.638 --> 00:01:27.254
Sid hung his head. "Sorry."

16
00:01:27.255 --> 00:01:30.167
"Okay," Tor said.

17
00:01:30.168 --> 00:01:33.209
But she still looked mad.

18
00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:40.613
She walked away.

19
00:01:40.614 --> 00:01:52.619
Sid started to gather berries.

20
00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.782
Then he saw Tor again.

21
00:01:55.783 --> 00:01:58.789
Tor was with another dinosaur.

22
00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:02.232
The dinosaur had wings.

23
00:02:02.233 --> 00:02:06.674
"Who is that?" Sid thought.

24
00:02:06.675 --> 00:02:10.025
Tor's new friend flew away.

25
00:02:10.026 --> 00:02:13.234
Sid gasped.

26
00:02:13.235 --> 00:02:17.156
Tor was flying away too!

